<view class="page-shell home-page">
  <view class="card hero-card">
    <image class="hero-background" src="/images/hero-home.jpg" mode="aspectFill"></image>
    <view class="hero-mask"></view>
    <view class="hero-content">
      <view class="hero-copy">
        <text class="hero-title">{{hero.title}}</text>
        <text class="hero-subtitle">{{hero.subtitle}}</text>
        <text class="hero-meta">已管理 {{managedCount}} 件物品</text>
      </view>
      <view class="hero-actions">
        <view class="button-primary hero-action" bindtap="handleAddItem">添加物品</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="filter-section">
    <view class="chip-row">
      <view
        wx:for="{{statusTabs}}"
        wx:key="value"
        class="chip status-chip {{item.isActive ? 'chip-active' : ''}} {{item.activeClass}}"
        data-value="{{item.value}}"
        bindtap="handleStatusTap"
      >
        {{item.label}}
        <view wx:if="{{item.showCount}}" class="status-count {{item.countClass}}">{{item.count}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="filter-section">
    <view class="chip-row category-row">
      <view
        wx:for="{{categoryOptions}}"
        wx:key="value"
        class="chip category-chip {{activeCategory === item.value ? 'chip-active chip-category-active' : ''}}"
        data-value="{{item.value}}"
        bindtap="handleCategoryTap"
      >
        {{item.label}}
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="list-section">
    <view class="list-header">
      <text class="section-title">物品列表</text>
      <text class="section-subtitle">按到期优先级排序</text>
    </view>

    <block wx:if="{{items.length}}">
      <view
        wx:for="{{items}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="card item-card"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bindtap="handleCardTap"
      >
        <view class="item-main">
          <view
            class="item-thumb"
            style="background: {{item.categoryColor}}; color: {{item.categoryTextColor}};"
          >
            <image wx:if="{{item.imageUrl}}" src="{{item.imageUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" class="thumb-image" />
            <text wx:else class="thumb-initial">{{item.displayInitial}}</text>
          </view>

          <view class="item-copy">
            <view class="item-topline">
              <view class="item-heading">
                <text class="item-name">{{item.name}}</text>
                <text
                  class="item-category-badge"
                  style="background: {{item.categoryColor}}; color: {{item.categoryTextColor}};"
                >{{item.categoryLabel}}</text>
              </view>
              <text class="status-badge status-{{item.statusType}}">{{item.statusText}}</text>
            </view>
            <text class="item-description">{{item.descriptionText}}</text>

            <view class="progress-block">
              <view class="progress-track">
                <view
                  class="progress-fill"
                  style="width: {{item.remainingPercent}}%; background: {{item.progressColor}};"
                ></view>
              </view>
              <view class="progress-meta">
                <text class="progress-days">{{item.statusText}}</text>
                <text class="progress-percent">{{item.remainingPercent}}%</text>
              </view>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </block>

    <view wx:else class="card empty-card">
      <text class="empty-title">{{emptyText}}</text>
      <view class="empty-action" bindtap="handleEmptyAction">{{emptyActionText}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>

<view wx:if="{{showUsageGuide}}" class="guide-mask" catchtap="handleCloseUsageGuide">
  <view class="guide-dialog card" catchtap="noop">
    <view class="guide-head">
      <text class="guide-title">使用说明</text>
      <view class="guide-close" bindtap="handleCloseUsageGuide">×</view>
    </view>
    <text class="guide-intro">这个小程序适合记录牙刷、床单、美妆、药品、食品等需要定期清洗、更换或处理的生活物品。</text>
    <view class="guide-list">
      <text class="guide-item">1. 先点“添加物品”，选择模板或自定义名称。</text>
      <text class="guide-item">2. 设置使用日期、周期天数和提前提醒时间。</text>
      <text class="guide-item">3. 回到首页后，优先查看“即将到期”和“已过期”提醒。</text>
      <text class="guide-item">4. 处理完成后，点“已更换 / 已清洗 / 已到期”，系统会自动进入下一周期。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="button-primary guide-button" bindtap="handleCloseUsageGuide">我知道了</view>
  </view>
</view>
